{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 156716, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 104935, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "DC韩语速成-1、母音（元音）", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1653123375, "updated_at": 1653288536, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1662787576, "last_at": 1682877335, "comment_count": 12, "status": 1, "summary": "元音是指发音时气流通过口腔未受阻而发出的音，比如汉语拼音中的“a、o、e、i、u、ü”。韩语中称元音为母音（모음），现在有21个，它们又分为10个单母音“ㅏ、ㅓ、ㅗ、ㅜ、ㅣ、ㅡ、ㅐ、ㅔ、ㅚ、ㅟ”和11", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 8265, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 156716, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div></div></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><div></div></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">元音是指发音时气流通过口腔未受阻而发出的音，比如汉语拼音中的“a、o、e、i、u、ü”。</span></span></span><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">韩语中称元音为母音（모음），现在有21个，它们又分为10个单母音“ㅏ、ㅓ、ㅗ、ㅜ、</span></span>ㅣ<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">、</span></span>ㅡ<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">、ㅐ、ㅔ、ㅚ、ㅟ”和11个复合母音“ㅑ、ㅕ、ㅛ、ㅠ、ㅒ、ㅖ、ㅘ、ㅙ、ㅝ、ㅞ、ㅢ”。</span></span></span><div><br></div></div></span></span><div><div></div><div><span style=\"\"><div></div></span></div></div></span><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">单母音</p></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div>发单母音的时候，口型要保持不变。</div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\">先来介绍长得像俄罗斯方块的六个单母音：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅏ</span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">：发音接近汉语拼音的“</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">”，但是嘴巴张开得比“</span></span><span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\"\">”小，舌头放松的平放在嘴里，声音没有“a”明亮。记忆方法：手写的“</span><span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\"\">”有一个向右的小尾巴，“</span>ㅏ<span style=\"\">”也一样。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅓ</span></span>：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">嘴巴张开得比“</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅏ</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">”小，舌头向后略缩一点，发音像“哦”，但是<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">口型</span>没有“哦”的圆。</span></span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅗ</span></span></span>：嘴巴做成小而圆的像吹口哨的形状，下巴低一些，保持这个<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">口型</span>，然后模拟刮风或是狼嚎？？的声音。</span><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅜ</span></span>：嘴巴向上撅起来，下巴高一些，发出类似汉语拼音“u”的声音。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">记忆方法：“<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅜ</span>”可以插进“u”里</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅣ</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">发音接近汉语拼音的“i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">”。</span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅡ</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">发音接近汉语拼音整体认读音节“zi、ci、si</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">”的后半部。也可以先发<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">汉语拼音</span>“i”的音，然后牙齿不动略微咧嘴，把舌头向后收（或者说是抬高舌根）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\">然后是长得像两个俄罗斯方块的两个单母音：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅐ</span></span>：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">发音接近汉语拼音整体认读音节“ye</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">”的后半部。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅔ</span></span>：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">发音接近“<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅐ</span>”，但<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">嘴巴张得</span></span>小一些。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\">最后是剩下的两个：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅚ</span>：有两种发音。传统单母音发音：做“</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅗ</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">”的口型发“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅔ</span>”，有一点点像汉语拼音<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">整体认读音节的“y<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ü</span>”</span>；</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">双元音发音：“</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅜ</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">”和</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">“ㅔ”连读。</span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅟ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">有两种发音。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">传统单母音发音</span>：做“</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅜ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">”的口型发“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅣ</span></span>”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，有一点点像汉语拼音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">整体认读音节的“y<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ü</span>”</span>；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">双元音发音：“</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">ㅜ</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">”和</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅣ</span>”连读。</span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">复合母音</p></div><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"></div></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\">复合母音简单来说就是把单母音连起来。</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span>ㅑ</span>：“ㅣ”和“ㅏ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅕ</span>：“ㅣ”和“ㅓ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span><span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅛ</span></span></span></span>：“ㅣ”和“ㅗ”连读。</div></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅠ</span></span>：“ㅣ”和“ㅜ”连读。</div></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅒ</span></span>：“ㅣ”和“ㅐ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅖ</span>：“ㅣ”和“ㅔ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅘ</span>：“ㅗ”和“ㅏ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅙ</span>：“ㅗ”和“ㅐ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅝ</span>：“ㅜ”和“ㅓ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅞ</span>：“ㅜ”和“ㅔ”连读。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅢ</span>：“ㅡ”和“ㅣ”连读。</div></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">发音区别</p></div><br></span></div></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅚ、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅙ</span>、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㅞ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">：韩国人自己都听不出。</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(75, 82, 91);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(75, 82, 91);\"><span>“</span>ㅣ、ㅡ、ㅜ<span>”</span><span>的发音</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span>练习</p></div><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">先发“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅣ</span>”的音，然后保持上下牙位置基本不动，舌头向后收，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">略微咧嘴，</span>发出“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅡ</span>”的音。继续<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">保持上下牙位置，舌根抬高一点点，撅嘴，发出<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">“</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">ㅜ</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">”的音。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div>（至此，韩语中所有的母音就都学完啦，撒花）</div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow_num": 33, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "锟斤拷烫烫烫", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 97889183, "content_num": 37, "read_num": 250944, "like_num": 332}, "update_user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow_num": 33, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "ga